<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Basis offers mostly unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Basis offers mostly unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lower CBOT soymeal futures Monday prompted a slight increase in buyer interest for soymeal, but volumes were light and sales were for prompt shipment, dealers said.</p>
<p>Also, buyers used the lower board to price soymeal they had bought previously but not priced or shipped.</p>
<p>At 1145 CDT, CBOT July soymeal was down $3.60 at $277.50 per ton.  </p>
<p>Spot rail soymeal (dollars/ton basis CBOT, 47.5 pct protein):</p>
